size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j <CR>
keys o
keys <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +work
B +home
-- a-frame --
┌[2]─Projects┐┌ [1]─+work ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home   1/1││  1       A                                                                   +work │
│>+work   1/1││                                                                                    │
├[3]─Contexts┤│                                                                                    │
│            ││                                                                                    │
├[4]─Filters─┤│                                                                                    │
│ [x] Done   ││                                                                                    │
│ [ ] Later  ││                                                                                    │
└────────────┘└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  x done  t state  o new  a append  dd delete  u undo  / search  ? help
-- a-file --
A +work
B +home
